# Ideal Client

## Primary Target

Service-based businesses where the business owner or a specific person is an important part of the sale.

## Examples

- Lawyers
- Dentists
- Doctors
- Real estate agents
- Accountants
- Financial advisors
- Insurance agents
- Coaches
- Therapists
- Consultants
- Personal trainers
- Nutritionists
- Chiropractors
- Aesthetic professionals

## Business Characteristics

The ideal client typically:

- Sells a service rather than a physical product.
- Acquires customers through social media and digital advertising.
- Uses platforms such as Instagram, TikTok, Facebook or similar channels.
- Relies on the business owner or another specific person appearing in videos and ads.
- Needs a consistent flow of high-quality video content and advertising creatives.

## Core Problem

The business owner often has to personally record videos and advertisements.

This creates a bottleneck because producing content requires their time, attention and availability.

## Why Our Service Is Relevant

Our AI-powered production system can create content and advertising creatives featuring a digital clone of the business owner.

This allows the business to produce more content and ads without requiring the owner to constantly record themselves.

## Current Focus

Focus primarily on service-based businesses where the person behind the business is an important part of the customer's buying decision.

## Not Currently a Focus

- E-commerce
- Physical products
- Product-focused businesses where the owner or a specific person is not central to the sale

This may change in the future.